{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-a-dece-oasis-ado-folding-electric-bikes-2605-0026","content_id":"97fca848-bbd1-41d1-8881-3c229c7a1fc1","description":"Product Safety Report for A Dece Oasis (ADO) Folding Electric Bikes presenting a serious risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"40e52855-c737-454d-bb59-435ea14a54a5","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:16:30+01:00","id":"40e52855-c737-454d-bb59-435ea14a54a5","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-06-26T15:16:30+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3e89be30b491f55b3c4b28/2605-0026-product-safety-report-ADO-folding-e-bikes.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: A Dece Oasis (ADO) Folding Electric Bikes</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injuries as a sharp edge was identified in the folding mechanism</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Cycles (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>A Dece Oasis (ADO)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Bike models</td>\n      <td>Air 20 Ultra &amp; Air 20 Pro, Air Carbon, Air 20S</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Folding electric bikes with wall plug and power supply.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_40e52855-c737-454d-bb59-435ea14a54a5\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3e89be30b491f55b3c4b28/2605-0026-product-safety-report-ADO-folding-e-bikes.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-product-identifiers\">Additional Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Power Supply</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Charger</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Other product identifiers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Air 20 Ultra &amp; Air 20 Pro</td>\n      <td>6974587225139, 6974587225115, 6974587225122</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n      <td>Product carton identifiers: 1-0022-6222-04, 03 &amp; 02, 1-0022-6822-03 &amp; 02, AFYQ2042510N00746U &amp; AFYQ2042510N00539</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Air Carbon</td>\n      <td>6974587224064</td>\n      <td>HSC-601</td>\n      <td>XVE85-4200200</td>\n      <td>Battery Charger: XVE85-4200200, Product carton identifiers: 1-0022-6002-02, AFLT2082507N00119.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Air 20S</td>\n      <td>6974587225092</td>\n      <td>HSC-601</td>\n      <td>XVE90-4200200</td>\n      <td>Battery Charger: XVE90-4200200, Product carton identifiers: 1-0022-6202-05 &amp; 1-0022-6902-05, AFHT2042510N00171.</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of injuries as a sharp edge was identified in the folding mechanism. Over time, this sharp edge may wear away the insulation of the product wiring, which could lead to the bike failing during use, potentially causing injuries to the user. Improvements are also required to the product documentation and marking.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0026</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-28T15:19:16Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Additional Product Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-28","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-28T16:19:16+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-a-dece-oasis-ado-folding-electric-bikes-2605-0026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-a-dece-oasis-ado-folding-electric-bikes-2605-0026","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-a-dece-oasis-ado-folding-electric-bikes-2605-0026","content_id":"97fca848-bbd1-41d1-8881-3c229c7a1fc1","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-28T15:19:16Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: A Dece Oasis (ADO) Folding Electric Bikes (2605-0026)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-a-dece-oasis-ado-folding-electric-bikes-2605-0026","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.u